title: Tbgoes takes power.
subtitle: The end of the republic is here.
view-if: chancellor == "Tbgoes" or president == "Tbgoes" or chancellor_party == "HP"
on-arrival: kcp_in_government = 0
tags: event
new-page: true

Tbgoes openly campaigned on the return of the monarchy and often flaunted his previous position as the emperor of Kaddu with him openly saying he would wish to return to this high office and reestablish the monarchy under himself. Now that he is the Primus and his coalition commands a majority the end of the republic is surely here.

What are we to do now?

- @give_up: We will have to wait for the next election cycle. Surely there will be one.

@give_up

The Republic is undone as the National Coalition destroys the KCPs creation. Soon the Senate is dissolved as legislative power is once more redelegated to local councils and leaders with Tbgoes unifying the positions of Primus and President into the title of Emperor of Kaddu once more. Opposition parties are banned the KCP is washed away by history.

- @game_over: Game over.
